  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rights, Resilience, Response (RRR) safe programming pilots</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This plan will be implemented in 10 fragile countries (Central African Republic, Chad, Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC), Iraq, Niger, Occupied Palestinian Territory and Israel (OPTI), Somalia, South Sudan, Syria and Yemen). This fund will be critical to supporting the adaptation and redesign of our programming and influence work by building on the work done under the Humanitarian, Development and Peace Nexus,   through three specific areas of work: leadership and knowledge retention to influence and transform practice,  the organization  itself as well as the sector; investment in initiatives at the national level and the integration of the safe programming approach.</narrative>
  </description>
